Shipped server list and Kad contacts
------------------------------------
A new profile starts from the server list and the Kad contacts published at
https://upd.emule-security.org (server.met and nodes.dat, downloaded unchanged
on 15 October 2026). They hold public addresses, ports and server names, facts
not covered by copyright (CC0-1.0 in REUSE.toml).
